5,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Since our household has grown, it is only logical to update our billing method. I suggest we look at the data first to avoid any... frosty surprises this winter.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mio,,I'm totally on board! I just want to make sure whatever we pick isn't a huge headache to manage every month. Who's going to do the math?,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree that a fresh start is best. It would be helpful to see if the current distribution is actually fair to everyone involved.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"I agree we need a new system. However, I believe it is essential to understand the annual fluctuations and any potential setup costs before we commit.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minato,,I want everyone to be happy. Maybe we can see how we've been paying so far? I hope we can all stay friends while we figure this out.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Mio, a template might solve your headache. I'm curious about the actual energy draw per room; it would be quite illuminating, wouldn't it?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Mio,,"Ooh, a template sounds like a lifesaver! I'm also curious about how other houses do it. Maybe they have a super easy trick we can steal!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Minato, looking at the payment logs is a good idea. I also think we should check the actual readings to see if some of us are using more than others.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Benjamin, while readings are useful, I am more concerned with the long-term financial pattern. I want to see the actual statements from the last year.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minato,,I think it would be good to see the payment log too. And maybe the things that happened when the last rooms were filled?,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"A fair point, Victoria. I shall balance my curiosity with some practical history. Let us ensure we have a comprehensive view of the situation.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Mio,,I'm just imagining a giant spreadsheet that takes ten hours to fill out... let's definitely avoid that! I'm excited to see what we find!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I believe that transparency will bring us peace. If we know the facts, there will be no need for guesswork or resentment.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"Precisely. I also want to know if there are any immediate costs associated with changing the infrastructure, such as separate metering.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minato,,"I just don't want anyone to feel bad. If we look at the logs, maybe we can see if anyone was sad about the money?","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"I believe we have a general consensus on the need for data. I shall leave you all to your selections, though I suspect we will find some interesting discrepancies.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Mio,,Yay! Let's do this! I'll go hunting for the easiest way to handle this so we can spend more time hanging out and less time doing math!,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I look forward to seeing the results. Let us proceed with kindness and an open mind.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I will focus on the financial reality of the past year and the costs of change. It is the only way to ensure stability.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Minato,,I'll do my best to help. I hope we can all be smiling when we decide.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
