35,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,It appears our rooms are not created equal. Some of us are essentially living in refrigerators while others bask in the sun. Quite a charming arrangement.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Mio,,"Guys, I looked into the templates and other houses... and it looks like a total nightmare! It takes forever to do the math every single month!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,I noticed some inconsistencies in the payment logs. It seems there has been some tension regarding the amounts requested in the past.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"The statements show extreme volatility between winter and summer. Furthermore, installing sub-meters would be an expensive and disruptive investment.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Minato,,I saw that some payments were late and people were confused. It makes me sad that the money made us feel bad toward each other.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Victoria, if sub-meters are too costly, we must find a logical way to account for the inherent unfairness of the room temperatures.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Benjamin, please don't suggest something that takes hours to calculate! I'm terrified we're going to end up with a monthly chore that kills our weekends!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Minato, it is okay to feel that way. The goal now is to create a system where no one feels they are carrying an unfair burden.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Benjamin, the cost is not just the money, but the disruption. However, the current volatility is unsustainable for those of us budgeting strictly.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@Jonathan, thank you. I just think we should be honest about how the money made us feel, so it doesn't happen again with the new rule.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Honesty is a virtue, but logic is a tool. If we simply split everything equally, the person in the coldest room will either freeze or pay for the luxury of others.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Mio,,"But if we make it too complex, the person doing the math will be the one who's miserable! Can't we just keep it super simple?","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,Perhaps a middle ground exists. We can acknowledge the difference in usage without making the administration a full-time job.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"A simple split is only ""simple"" if the costs are predictable. The current swings make a flat monthly fee difficult without a large reserve.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Minato,,"I agree with Mio that it should be simple, but I agree with Jonathan that it should be fair. I just want us to be nice.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,I suspect we are all circling the same problem: the tension between simplicity and equity. I look forward to seeing the proposed options.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Mio,,I'm crossing my fingers for the simplest option possible! I really don't want to spend my evenings staring at a calculator!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,Let us consider the options carefully. The peace of the house depends on a solution that satisfies both the mind and the heart.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Victoria,,I will be looking for a solution that provides financial predictability and avoids high upfront costs.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Minato,,I hope we pick the one that makes everyone feel the most loved and respected.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
